WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.690
You met the life root and the breath root.

00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:05.980
Now decide which one is hiding in each word.

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:08.420
Some words carry both ideas.

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:11.760
Then sort the describing words by their endings.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:14.440
Find the smaller word inside first.

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:17.870
Then the footprint game has six new words to build.
